/**
 * Convars readable, gamemode half not.
 *
 * A REAL AND UNDRAMATIC FAILURE. The game host reads convars with shell
 * builtins, but the gamemode values need a Lua interpreter and nothing
 * guarantees one is installed. Half a report is worth showing, and the reason
 * is worth naming: "install lua5.4" is something an operator can act on, where
 * a silently empty section is something they file a bug about.
 *
 * FXServer is also stopped here (`startedAt: 0`), which is why staleness is
 * not claimed — with no process there is no "since it started", and saying
 * "your edits are not live" would be a strange way to report "nothing is".
 */
